<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds draw strength from Bunds into close.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds draw strength from Bunds into close.</headline>
<text>
<p>1530 GMT - Government bonds step higher drawing strength from Bunds and U.S. Treasuries ahead of holiday on Friday.</p>
<p>* 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 107.18 vs 106.85, yield 6.32 vs 6.36</p>
<p>* Sept bond future 116.83 vs 116.45 at Wednesday's close</p>
<p>* Peseta/mark 84.52/53 vs 84.51/52</p>
